{"unit_id":"yuehancn__dsh-tool-comfyui#card-zh","repo":"yuehancn/dsh-tool-comfyui","commit":"120f20beb6751b7e3264a8271c86d94cebbbeca5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-comfyui 是面向 DSH 的 ComfyUI 图片生成工具插件，可在 web 和 desktop profile 中使用。它通过模型可调用的工具接入本地或局域网 ComfyUI worker，并根据工作流模板提交提示词、等待生成完成，再返回图片文件路径。主要能力包括查询 worker 在线状态、版本、显卡与队列，按模板生成图片、设置负面提示词和随机种子、指定批量张数，以及查看或清空任务队列。适合希望在 DSH 对话中直接调用自有 ComfyUI 设备出图的用户；需要配置可访问的 worker 地址，不需要 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:403-645","lib/index.js:59-85"]}
{"unit_id":"yuehancn__dsh-tool-comfyui#card-en","repo":"yuehancn/dsh-tool-comfyui","commit":"120f20beb6751b7e3264a8271c86d94cebbbeca5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-comfyui connects DSH to local or LAN ComfyUI workers. It submits prompts to named workflows, waits for generation and returns image paths. Users can inspect worker health, GPU and queue status, set prompts and seeds, and request batches. Configure worker URLs; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:403-645","lib/index.js:59-85"]}
